not rough.**  \n   - Fiona is not quiet and is kind, so this rule doesn't apply to her.\n\n8. **All round, cold things are rough.**  \n   - Fiona is round and cold, so she is rough.\n\n### Conclusion:\nBased on the given premises, Fiona is rough.\n\n**Final Answer:**  \n\\boxed{A) True}",
